  "name": "oheco-broker",
  "description": "带账号审批、WSS 信令和 STUN/TURN 的加密端口映射工具，提供独立服务端及完整 C/Go/.NET 源码 SDK",
  "upstream": "https://github.com/oheco/oheco-broker",
